# Environment-file backups and editor/tool snapshots — REAL credentials were
# committed this way once (backend/.env.before-expiration-fix,
# backend/.env.pre-s3-dedupe-20261018-071203). These are ignored so the class
# cannot be re-added by accident; legitimate templates are the *.env.example
# files, which stay tracked. Note: removing a file from the latest revision
# does NOT erase its copies from earlier Git history — rotate any exposed
# secret.
*.env.*
!*.env.example
# Snapshots of tracked scripts (e.g. verify-local-environment.sh.pre-keycloak-*).
*.sh.pre-*
frontend/test-results/
*.patch
